OL,3,GNEWSAExtra police out for Halloween and
OL,4,ABonfire Night
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtra police will be on the streets of
OL,7,FWest Yorkshire for Halloween and
OL,8,FBonfire Night, the county's force has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FA spokesperson said the two dates, 31
OL,12,FOctober and 5 November, were among the
OL,13,Fbusiest times of the years for officers
OL,14,Fand urged those out and about to be
OL,15,Fconsiderate.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
