OL,3,GNEWSAExtra police out for Halloween and
OL,4,ABonfire Night
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn other years, the force has had to
OL,7,Fdeal with dozens of motorcycles being
OL,8,Fused dangerously in a group "ride-out",
OL,9,Fserious disorder which saw riot police
OL,10,Fbeing supported by the force helicopter
OL,11,Fand also helping fire crews when they
OL,12,Fhave been attacked.
OL,14,FThe force also said anyone using
OL,15,FHalloween and Bonfire Night as an
OL,16,F"excuse for disorder" would be
OL,17,Fprosecuted.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
